Luke 22:1 , The Jews conspire against Christ;
Luke 22:3 , Satan prepares Judas to betray him;
Luke 22:7 , The apostles prepare the passover;
Luke 22:19 , Christ institutes his holy supper;
Luke 22:21 , covertly foretells of the traitor;
Luke 22:24 , rebukes the rest of his apostles from ambition;
Luke 22:31 , assures Peter his faith should not fail;
Luke 22:34 , and yet he should deny him thrice;
Luke 22:39 , He prays in the mount, and sweats blood;
Luke 22:47 , is betrayed with a kiss;
Luke 22:50 , he heals Malchus' ear;
Luke 22:54 , he is thrice denied of Peter;
Luke 22:63 , shamefully abused;
Luke 22:66 , and confesses himself to be the Son of God.
